{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGER ZERO</strong> is an action-roguelike with political simulator elements. You play as a mercenary with the code name &quot;Viper&quot;, doing jobs for powerful factions with varying ideologies and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The missions you undertake, the relationships you build, and your choices will determine the fate of the star system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MERCENARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy onto <strong>a variety of procedurally generated planets</strong> to complete missions for clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.poster.avif?t=1769932779\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.webm?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.mp4?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE MECH BUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own mech using hundreds of unique parts. Mech building is simple and straightforward.\u00a0<strong>Any build is viable, and there are literally millions of possible combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.poster.avif?t=1769932779\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.webm?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.mp4?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY SECOND MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days pass with each mission you complete. Over time, the number of pilots in the star system will <strong>dynamically fight each other based on their alignments, relationships, and more</strong>. Make the most of the time you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The war will end, with or without you.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLEND OF LO-FI AND HEAVY METAL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack mixes together different genres of music. There is calm, lo-fi music during down time, which ramps up and explodes into heavy metal during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESTORE HOPE TO A HOPELESS WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has their own agenda, their own views on the world and how it should be run. Depending on who you side with, a variety of different endings can be achieved. You can save the world, stopping the forces that threaten the balance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... Or you can take it for yourself.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168670?t=1769932779","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769932779","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/12ff078ce8f1d7dff26939f562820f8aab335776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769932779","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/12ff078ce8f1d7dff26939f562820f8aab335776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769932779","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"SCAVENGER ZERO contains themes of depression and self harm. Alcohol is consumed by characters throughout the game."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGER ZERO</strong> is an action-roguelike with political simulator elements. You play as a mercenary with the code name &quot;Viper&quot;, doing jobs for powerful factions with varying ideologies and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The missions you undertake, the relationships you build, and your choices will determine the fate of the star system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MERCENARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy onto <strong>a variety of procedurally generated planets</strong> to complete missions for clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.poster.avif?t=1769932779\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.webm?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.mp4?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE MECH BUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own mech using hundreds of unique parts. Mech building is simple and straightforward.\u00a0<strong>Any build is viable, and there are literally millions of possible combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.poster.avif?t=1769932779\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.webm?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.mp4?t=1769932779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY SECOND MATTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days pass with each mission you complete. Over time, the number of pilots in the star system will <strong>dynamically fight each other based on their alignments, relationships, and more</strong>. Make the most of the time you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The war will end, with or without you.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLEND OF LO-FI AND HEAVY METAL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack mixes together different genres of music. There is calm, lo-fi music during down time, which ramps up and explodes into heavy metal during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESTORE HOPE TO A HOPELESS WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has their own agenda, their own views on the world and how it should be run. Depending on who you side with, a variety of different endings can be achieved. You can save the world, stopping the forces that threaten the balance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... Or you can take it for yourself.</i></p>","developers":["Keenan Dignam"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/header.jpg?t=1769932779","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SCAVENGER ZERO \u00a9 2024 - 2026 Keenan \"Keenan_Dev\" Dignam, All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3168670/1548727688/09c90858bbdb5603de4d43eb65837b11c5136658/1762930473/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763092458","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3168670/1548727688/09c90858bbdb5603de4d43eb65837b11c5136658/1762930473/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763092458","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3168670/1548727688/09c90858bbdb5603de4d43eb65837b11c5136658/1762930473/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763092458","id":257229911,"name":"Teaser Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229911/cde1d949290294e9193203ce25e2fd07271bd796/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763092458"}],"name":"SCAVENGER ZERO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</l